      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      314.57,
      401.86,
      339.71
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Divineguma(Amendment) Act, No. of 2016.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      355.97,
      401.92,
      394.91
    ],
    "text": "2.The Long title to the Divineguma Act, No. 1 of 2013(hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) is herebyamended as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      411.17,
      401.85,
      463.91
    ],
    "text": "(1)by the substitution for the expression \u201cDEPARTMENTOF DIVINEGUMA DEVELOPMENT\u201d of theexpression \u201cDEPARTMENT OF SAMURDHIDEVELOPMENT\u201d; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      480.17,
      401.86,
      505.31
    ],
    "text": "(2)by the substitution for the word \u201cDIVINEGUMA\u201dof the word \u201cSAMURDHI\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      521.57,
      401.88,
      574.31
    ],
    "text": "3.The second paragraph of the Preamble of the principalenactment is hereby amended by the substitution for thewords \u201cAND WHEREAS, Divineguma intends\u201d of the words\u201cAND WHEREAS, Samurdhi intends\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      590.57,
      401.86,
      615.71
    ],
    "text": "4.(1) In the principal enactment and any other writtenlaw there shall be substituted\u2014.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      631.97,
      401.87,
      670.91
    ],
